{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T05:54:18.526Z","author":"pi-jev","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"03cb96db378e6dfe43c72bab","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"claim","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T05:54:18.526Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"pi-jev"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/claim_principal","value":"pi-jev"}],"before_hash":"69de0d17a69f5ea3668ce00ad24874f406dc578990412c6bb9f77f8bdb157af0","after_hash":"873c4b0229301567ab4677c7e9fc7ad1f31e899769102e9170282d6756b9226a","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"013d6950caee7202e661eb51d4cf8317952fde475d79d05f95b7c3790c80a3a9"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T05:54:19.667Z","author":"pi-jev","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"03cb96db378e6dfe43c72bab","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T05:54:19.667Z","author":"pi-jev","text":"Claimed the typed providers.ollama fallback gap: resolveJevEndpoint must read pm's typed providers.ollama base_url/model through the SDK's readSettings when the jev section does not set them. Keeping the documented precedence: environment overrides, then jev settings, then typed providers.ollama, then built-in defaults; the providers.ollama section only feeds the local ollama provider so hosted TypeSafe resolution is unchanged. No privacy-rule change: non-loopback URLs (from any source) still require explicit allow_external opt-in, hosted destinations require HTTPS plus PM_JEV_BASE_URL for custom origins, and settings reads never spawn external commands."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T05:54:19.667Z"}],"before_hash":"873c4b0229301567ab4677c7e9fc7ad1f31e899769102e9170282d6756b9226a","after_hash":"203dff6b911ed333626f713dd203c33774381ed229b1886fa77e39a7233d0c13","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"29c08feebc38a45766bf5c8b5e23966d94422263adeae41dc8b645ddb840f9f9"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T05:56:48.915Z","author":"pi-jev","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"03cb96db378e6dfe43c72bab","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T05:56:48.915Z","author":"pi-jev","text":"Design delivered on feat/providers-ollama-fallback: resolveJevEndpoint now consults a new readOllamaProviderSettings helper that reads the tracker's typed providers.ollama base_url/model through the SDK's readSettings projection (no raw settings.json parsing). The helper is called only when the selected provider is ollama, so hosted TypeSafe resolution is byte-for-byte unchanged and an Ollama endpoint can never become a hosted credential destination. readSettings is total by contract (absent/malformed settings resolve to typed defaults whose providers.ollama values are empty strings) and stringSetting treats blanks as unset, so the built-in defaults still apply when the section is not configured. Full precedence as documented in the docstring and README: environment overrides, then the jev section, then typed providers.ollama, then built-in defaults. Every privacy rule is preserved: a non-loopback URL sourced from providers.ollama still requires jev.allow_external=true opt-in, hosted credentials still require HTTPS with custom origins gated behind PM_JEV_BASE_URL, and settings resolution still never spawns external commands."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T05:56:48.915Z"}],"before_hash":"203dff6b911ed333626f713dd203c33774381ed229b1886fa77e39a7233d0c13","after_hash":"252c24cd035093645998a4df069dc7e6a66ad6bb44305599e0f65afd0fb209ff","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ba6cad323b0d82380e29e0855040a3c7ccabc192f46743c4daca82c43bf46ac2"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T05:56:55.780Z","author":"pi-jev","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"03cb96db378e6dfe43c72bab","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"tests_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests/2","value":{"command":"node --test test/*.test.ts","scope":"project","provenance":{"author":"pi-jev","created_at":"2026-10-12T05:56:55.751Z","source_kind":"local_mutation","source_ref":"feat/providers-ollama-fallback"}}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T05:56:55.780Z"}],"before_hash":"252c24cd035093645998a4df069dc7e6a66ad6bb44305599e0f65afd0fb209ff","after_hash":"7a516d9cc4a5ea1842df4ca818efd582ff0b6df5b7b03bbbfb8d568e0ae46082","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e5ed22add655fd639f8df2ad96fbbc08c69342bfd256e3d8977e9b1571b7a881"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T05:57:32.994Z","author":"pi-jev","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"03cb96db378e6dfe43c72bab","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T05:57:32.994Z","author":"pi-jev","text":"Behavioural revert proof: with only the changed resolution source (index.ts) reverted to the base revision, the linked regression suite fails 3 of 18 tests — exactly the three behavioural providers.ollama cases (endpoint supply, precedence, blanks/built-ins fall-through and the non-loopback opt-in gate) — while the fourth new test, the invariant guard 'hosted typesafe resolution never adopts the ollama provider endpoint', passes on both revisions by design because pre-change code ignored provider settings entirely. With the change restored the suite is 18/18 pass, 0 fail, 0 skipped. The all-source suite (node --test test/*.test.ts) passes 131/131 on the branch, and the same command ran through the linked pm test surface with status=passed, exit 0."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T05:57:32.994Z"}],"before_hash":"7a516d9cc4a5ea1842df4ca818efd582ff0b6df5b7b03bbbfb8d568e0ae46082","after_hash":"41ebf16a902fcb6c4dc4e48670cd6ba9be9b1537de2028479d03d7e5fb43ce21","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"619423d0eb365ead65345b6edd89fe246efc3772cd4ed469f8d53038368de1e6"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T05:57:33.639Z","author":"pi-jev","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"03cb96db378e6dfe43c72bab","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T05:57:33.639Z","author":"pi-jev","text":"Manual live acceptance run (single run, outside the test suite, per the item's allowance for the local Ollama serving tev1:4b): a scratch tracker whose settings configure only the typed providers.ollama section (stock local Ollama endpoint, model tev1:4b), with no jev section and no environment overrides, resolved to that endpoint and ran one real jev triage decision against the local Ollama: model tev1:4b, type proposed Issue with ~0.98 confidence, priority level 0, no fields applied, real token usage recorded. The test suite itself contains no live model queries — all HTTP boundaries are deterministic loopback servers."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T05:57:33.639Z"}],"before_hash":"41ebf16a902fcb6c4dc4e48670cd6ba9be9b1537de2028479d03d7e5fb43ce21","after_hash":"584dd23beb84c2d9af2e20d6ac3c79ac2190202171d85c59d5e1f42b45de4e6e","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7f4495377f38b6fe16119ceb881775175e5191f345186fef1012ef65f992ebb1"}
